<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s263S">It <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w19">is</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s263w18">not</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s263w1">though</span> the case that, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s263w4">from</span> the time it <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w2">first</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w3">started</span>, the glass of water <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w9">came</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w7">with</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w6">three</span> different <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w5">parts</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s263w10">or</span> that they <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w17">stay</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w15">with</span> the glass of water <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s263w14">until</span> it <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w11">eventually</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w13">ends</span>. What happens is that <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w27">one</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w26">parts</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w24">glass</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w25">filled</span> with <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w20">wet</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s263w21">and</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w22">flowing</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w23">water</span> provides a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w29">material cause</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s263w30">and</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w33">karma</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s263w32">of</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w31">craving spirit</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w36">provides</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w35">contributing factor</span>; and then <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w37">based on</span> both of these the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w42">later</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w41">continuation</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s263w40">of</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w39">one</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w38">part</span> of the glass of water <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w45">starts being</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s263w43"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s263m2">blood</span> and <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s263m1">pus</span></span>.<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s263w8"><span class="nul">Adverbial ldan du construction; no separate English exponent.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s263w12"><span class="nul">Temporal ma ... bar du is recast as until ... ends; no separate English negation belongs to this ma.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s263w16"><span class="nul">Adverbial ldan du construction; no separate English exponent.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s263w28"><span class="nul">Agent marking realized by active subject syntax, without a separate case word.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s263w34"><span class="nul">Agent marking realized by active subject syntax, without a separate case word.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s263w44"><span class="nul">Resultative relation is carried by the predicate complement after starts being, with no separate English particle.</span></span></span>
