<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, reconciliation. The two grub occurrences own started and came separately. In the temporal ma zhig ... bar du construction, ma has no separate negative word: its not-yet boundary force is fused into until ... ends. This explicit grammatical-fusion null is distinct from matrix ma/not and yin/is. mthar/eventually, zhig/ends and bar du/until retain the useful temporal atoms, excluding the supplied subject it; zhig's unrelated auto-aligned three principal paths gloss is not used. The second cha shas gsum is resumed pronominally in they and omitted as distributed content; second ldan/with retains the possession relation despite reversal of English subject orientation. cing/or coordinates the alternatives under negation. The full source chu/phor pa selects the third English water/glass in the wet-and-flowing material description. The lone byas pa owns the second provides beside contributing factor; the first provides restates the shared causal predication. brten nas is the established based on unit; both of these is explanatory expansion of the two causes. rnag khrag owns blood and pus with a contiguous d7 member block: rnag/pus followed by khrag/blood in Tibetan order. Both are unique and strictly tighter inside that same parent; the canonical generator resolves their reversed English order. Correction round1 restores the second member after rejecting the earlier erroneous one-member interpretation. Both member entries are glossary HTG2016; the original English evidence's corpus-mined characterization is incorrect and remains preserved only as original wording. Resultative tu has no separate particle beyond starts being. All source forms remain exact.</div>
